mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: runway\ndescription: >-\n  Prompt and direct Runway (Gen-4.5, Aleph) — the control-grade generative video tool for camera moves, character consistency, and edit-grade shots. Use when someone wants \"a specific camera\n  move,\" \"the same character across multiple shots,\" \"to edit/restyle existing footage,\" \"a branded\n  product/ad shot,\" \"film-style previz,\" \"image to video with Runway\" (animate a still), or names\n  Runway / Gen-4 / Gen-4.5 / Aleph / Act-Two / Motion Brush / References.\n  Runway generates clips; a human assembles/edits; audio comes from ai-voiceover; WoopSocial\n  schedules/publishes. Below the ai-video router, sibling to veo-3 (all-round + native audio),\n  kling (native 4K/multi-shot/motion), and luma (cinematic HDR/mood). Consented performances only\n  (Act-Two); AI disclosure mandatory.\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
